# Attorney Ramin design system — static hosting (Apache / LiteSpeed shared hosting)
Options -Indexes
DirectoryIndex index.html

AddType font/woff2 .woff2
AddType text/markdown .md
AddType application/json .json
AddType image/svg+xml .svg
AddDefaultCharset utf-8

# Keep the source files out of search results
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header set X-Robots-Tag "noindex, nofollow"
</IfModule>

# Don't serve the brief or local editor settings if they get uploaded by mistake
<IfModule mod_authz_core.c>
  <FilesMatch "^(prompt\.txt|settings\.json)$">
    Require all denied
  </FilesMatch>
</IfModule>
